title: Implement HTTP hook type
updated_at: "2026-08-02T04:22:15Z"
---
POST event JSON to configured URL. Headers with env var interpolation (allowedEnvVars). Non-2xx = non-blocking error (execution continues). 2xx + JSON body parsed same as command hooks. Timeout support.